			<xs:annotation>
				<xs:documentation>Fore color to use when drawing the object. Hexadecimal formatted values preceded by the # character or decimal values are accepted along with the following predefined color values: black, blue, cyan, darkGray, gray, green, lightGray, magenta, orange, pink, red, yellow, white.</xs:documentation>
